  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The idea is to provide a means that users can add new services to the camel toolbox by simply linking an external jar containing an @Configuration tagged java class.   ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Perhaps it could work by dropping the jar in a specific directory or something like that. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
